$('applyMargins').onclick=()=>{if(!sourceImage)return;try{const next={};for(const side of ['top','bottom','left','right']){const value=Number($('margin'+side[0].toUpperCase()+side.slice(1)).value);if(!Number.isInteger(value)||value<0||value>2000)throw Error('留白請輸入 0–2000 的整數');next[side]=value}const padded=paddedImage(sourceImage,next);const dx=next.left-margins.left,dy=next.top-margins.top;items.forEach(o=>{o.x+=dx;o.y+=dy});margins=next;image=padded;canvas.width=image.width;canvas.height=image.height;selected=-1;$('dimensions').textContent=image.width+' × '+image.height+' px';commit();fit();toast('已套用留白，可使用文字工具在空白區加上說明')}catch(e){toast(e.message)}};
